External dependencies are not bundled:
- Robust Video Matting: https://github.com/PeterL1n/RobustVideoMatting
  Official model weights are GPL-3.0. The optional downloader preserves
  the upstream license next to the downloaded weights.
- ONNX Runtime: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
- FFmpeg: https://ffmpeg.org/
- GSAP: https://gsap.com/community/standard-license/
- Departure Mono: https://github.com/rektdeckard/departure-mono (SIL OFL)
- IBM Plex: https://github.com/IBM/plex (SIL OFL)

The two bundled CTA WAV files are locally synthesized PCM sounds, with
no speech or third-party recordings. They are distributed under this
package's Apache-2.0 license.
